00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.663
-(ROB LAUGHS)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.432
-So...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:18.504
So, I stood up and I said,
"My name is Al Einstein,

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:21.407
I'm from Los Angeles."
And Rob's way in the back,

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.943
and then 40 other people,
and then he stands up

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:27.380
in the back and I don't--
I just hear "Rob from New York,"

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:29.214
I never heard any last name.

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:32.618
So, after the class,
I choose to come up to him.

00:02:33.018 --> 00:02:34.554
"You're from New York, huh?"

00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:36.989
Now, two weeks earlier,

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:39.825
I went to a museum
of broadcasting,

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:42.762
just because I loved it,
and I met Carl Reiner.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.763
-BILL: Hmm.
-I shook his hand.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.366
I said to him,
"So, what are you doing

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.968
from New York?
What does your dad do?"

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.737
Rob goes, "He's a writer."

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:52.505
I don't know why, Bill,

00:02:52.571 --> 00:02:55.041
but I said,
"I know Carl Reiner."

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.843
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.113
-ALBERT: And--
-(CHUCKLES)

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.715
And I said, "So do I."

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.517
-Yeah.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:08.821
-BILL: Oh.
-(ALBERT CHUCKLES)

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:13.860
And he said, "That's my dad."
And I said, "I'm a stupid fuck."

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:16.062
-(LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:16.128 --> 00:03:18.564
But your dad thought
