when you were just two,

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:43.675
-you know?
-ROB: Well, we had a house.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:45.110
-We had a house together.
-We roomed together

00:05:45.177 --> 00:05:46.178
-after college.
-Yeah.

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:49.481
We have a house up in...
